{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99921","id":2210118871,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Du7zX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99921","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99921.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99921.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99921","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99921/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99921/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99921/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3cc43abab07971349c8f6c7b40179485cf430442","number":99921,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Document inverse aspect ratio convention of `Projection::get_fovy()`","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`Projection::get_fovy()` takes the inverse of the \"regular\" X:Y aspect ratio as a argument.\r\nI just lost 15mins today until I figured this out.\r\n\r\nThere is already an open discussion (#81394) on whether it should be harmonized or not.\r\nThis PR just documents the current status quo in the meantime as it is very misleading right now.\r\n\r\nTest project : [get_fov.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17977162/get_fov.zip)\r\n\r\nScript :\r\n```GDScript\r\nvar proj = Projection.create_perspective(30, 0.8, 0.2, 10.0) # Y-fov 30 degrees, X:Y aspect 0.8\r\nprint(\"X fov : \", proj.get_fov())\r\nprint(\"X:Y aspect : \", proj.get_aspect())\r\nprint(\"Y:X aspect : \", 1.0 / proj.get_aspect())\r\nprint(\"Y fov : \" , Projection.get_fovy(proj.get_fov(), 1.0 / proj.get_aspect()))\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput :\r\n```\r\nX fov : 24.1975421905518\r\nX:Y aspect : 0.79999989271164\r\nY:X aspect : 1.25000016763809\r\nY fov : 29.9999542236328\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/